<title>FRANCE: EU cuts wheat flour refund to 17.00 Ecus.</title>
<headline>EU cuts wheat flour refund to 17.00 Ecus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday cut the daily refund on soft wheat flour exports to 17.00 Ecus per tonne from 20.00 Ecus, member state officials said.</p>
<p>The EU had last week cut the refund to 20.00 Ecus from 24.50 Ecus.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
